  "description": "Look up any color on OpenColors, the free keyless color data API. Turn a hex code into RGB, HSL, HSV and CMYK, find out whether someone has named it and who, or get the nearest named color and how far off it is. Check a color's WCAG 2.1 contrast against white and black, see it as people with each kind of color blindness do, check which of up to a hundred colors are still unnamed in one request, search the colors people have named, and pull the official palettes of more than 600 brands, from Spotify's green to Netflix's red.",
  "display_name": "OpenColors",
  "id": "opencolors"
}
